    "sub_name": "高分子分析技術特論",
    "sub_ename": "SPECIAL TOPICS IN POLYMER CHARACTERIZATION TECHNIQUE",
    "describe_ch": "本課程在介紹合成聚合物分析技術之理論和應用。內容涵蓋：1. x光粉末繞射分析，繞射圖片與繞射光譜分析法 2.示差掃描熱分析原理與應用3.紅外光譜分析原理與應用4.掃描式電子顯微鏡分析原理與應用 5.穿透式電子顯微鏡分析原理與應用",
    "describe_eh": "This course gives the theory and application of characterization methodology of  synthetic polymers. Topics include the X-ray diffraction by polymers, differential scanning calorimetric study of polymers, Fourier transform infrared spectroscopy study of polymers, and characterization of polymers by scanning electron microscopy (SEM) and transmission electron microscopy (TEM).",
